	(text "SIDE_LOAD goes low when the converter samples: both registers take their inputs at that instant.\nThe clock of the converter then shifts them out, most significant bit first:\nMUX_A1, MUX_A0 (range), GATE_OUT, VIN_OV, CMP_OC, CMP_JUMP, CMP_UP, PWR_GOOD, then logic inputs 7 down to 0.\nThe controller reads SIDE_DOUT and the converter data together, so every sample carries its own context.\nRN4 and RN5 hold the logic inputs low while the DUT side of the translator has no supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "baab8289-208a-5661-af18-53b243deb290")
	)
